stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT: Document Birth
    DRAFT --> COLLABORATING: Share / Start Collaboration
    COLLABORATING --> UNDER_REVIEW: Submit for Review
    UNDER_REVIEW --> COLLABORATING: Reject / Revision Required
    UNDER_REVIEW --> APPROVED: Review Passed
    APPROVED --> FREEZE: Baseline Lock
    FREEZE --> PUBLISHED: Publish & Open Asset
    PUBLISHED --> ITERATING: Change Request Approved
    ITERATING --> COLLABORATING: Unlock for Iteration
    PUBLISHED --> ARCHIVED: Lifecycle Final Closed
    PUBLISHED --> DELETED: Asset Retire (Pending Destruction)
    ARCHIVED --> [*]: Permanent Read-Only
    DELETED --> [*]: Permanent Destruction (Audit Evidence Retained)
